  message: "Proto-to-handler gap fixed in PR #2142 — dispatches_to edge bridges grpc_server to grpc_service, enabling full client→handler traversal. Remaining gaps (Solidity-to-TS ABI bridges, Electron IPC channel coverage) are niche domain-specific linkers that can be addressed when those ecosystems are prioritized."  # 5075
